# The third-party drivers that no image holds. Each needs a decision
# before it gets an image: Fishcamp and iNova PLx cameras, whose vendors
# no longer sell them, and the LimeSDR radio receiver, which is not
# observatory equipment. The build refuses a third-party driver that is
# in no list, so a driver that a new INDI release adds is a decision.
driver indi_fishcamp_ccd
driver indi_inovaplx_ccd
driver indi_limesdr_receiver
